## 9. Validation Plan
- Upload PDF sales invoice from chat -> review -> submit -> sales screen opens with prefill.
- Upload purchase bill image from chat -> review -> submit -> purchase screen opens with prefill.
- Upload `inventory_import_template.csv` -> review -> submit -> Data Exchange inventory tab opens with source.
- Upload `all_ledgers_mixed_import_template.csv` -> review -> submit -> Data Exchange ledger tab opens.
- Upload unclear file -> review requires manual destination choice.

## 10. Risks and Mitigations
- OCR quality variance across uploads:
  - Mitigation: force confirmation gate and manual override.
- Web OCR limitations:
  - Mitigation: provide direct manual route actions and import screens.
- Misclassification for spreadsheets:
  - Mitigation: use deterministic fallback and manual choice in review dialog.
